@startuml GetInputOperationServerNameFromForwarding
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

title
GetInputOperationServerNameFromForwarding – Retrieve Input Operation Server Name
end title

participant "requestor" as requestor
participant "Operation Server " as osr #LightCyan
participant "JSON Driver" as jd #LightYellow
participant "config.json" as cfg #LightGrey

note over requestor
  - forwardingName
end note

requestor -> osr: (forwardingName)
activate osr

osr -> jd: read forwarding-domain & forwarding-constructs
activate jd

jd <-> cfg: retrieve control-construct
jd --> osr: forwarding-construct list
deactivate jd

note over osr
  <u>Processing</u>
  - Locate forwarding-construct by forwardingName  
  - Read fc-port list of the forwarding-construct  
  - Identify fc-port with:
      * port-direction = INPUT  
  - Resolve logical-termination-point UUID from fc-port  
  - Read operation-server LTP  
  - Extract operation-name from operation-server capability  
  - Return operation server name  
  - Return undefined if no INPUT fc-port or operation server exists
end note

osr --> requestor: operationServerName | undefined
deactivate osr

@enduml
